Evidence 3: He made a brief appearance as mine owner Bob Freeman in the 2016 drama 94 Feet. He had a role on The Love Boat as Sergeant Belouski in Season 4, Episode 1. In 2010, Wilcox was charged with securities fraud by the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC), after being caught by undercover FBI agents in a penny stock kickback scheme. He pled guilty to securities fraud conspiracy and was sentenced to three years probation. Wilcox married Hannie Strasse, a member of the CHIPs sound crew, in 1980.
